direction: down
c0: "ConstructUsing(s => expression)\non the map?"
cu1: "One-parameter lambda with an expression body,\nnothing of the profile used?"
cu2: "Expression (s → source) is the creation;\nall members mapped after it"
q1: "Destination class has one public constructor\n(copy constructor excluded)?"
q2: "Several constructors: take the one with the most\nparameters AutoMapper can resolve (first declared on a tie)"
new0: "new() { ... } (public parameterless wins)"
mcu: "Manual: ResolutionContext, block body,\nmethod group, profile member or captured parameter"
m1: "Manual: no public constructor, or none resolvable"
to_next_q5: "Continued in Figure 1b: Remaining members (not filled by a parameter)\npass the member rules?" {shape: page; style: {fill: "#e5e7eb"; font-color: "#000000"}}
to_next_q3: "Continued in Figure 1b: Per parameter: one readable source member\nwith the same name in any case,\nnot ref/out/params, no ForMember on it?" {shape: page; style: {fill: "#e5e7eb"; font-color: "#000000"}}
to_next_q2b: "Continued in Figure 1b: Chosen constructor decidable\n(no flattening doubt, no private one,\nno ForMember on a parameter)?" {shape: page; style: {fill: "#e5e7eb"; font-color: "#000000"}}
c0 -> cu1: yes
c0 -> q1: no
cu1 -> mcu: no
cu1 -> cu2: yes
cu2 -> to_next_q5
